# PLI-ZERO-ASTRA-Z1 — basket-first computational mass card

**COMPUTATIONAL DRAFT / NOT COMPOUNDED.** Physical release remains HOLD. New-origin design; nominal bottle target 30 mL / 20% v/v raw-stock concentrate. This card specifies **6.500 g** of master, not 6.500 mL. It contains **4.000 g supplied fragrant products + 2.500 g known stock carriers**. Product mass is not a chemical-purity assay.

**Workflow: computational perfumery only, then one final complete blend.** No physical omission samples, A/B bottles, component smell trials or repeated trial batches are requested. Z1 is a computational working draft; the final candidate has not been newly selected by this document-only amendment. The stock-preparation information below records possible future build requirements, not a request to prepare or test anything now.

The wood accord is Sandalore body + Ebanol accent + Virginia cedar grain + Iso E Super space. Full design, sources, risks and report: [Z1 formula](Prada_LHomme_Intense_Zero_Astra_Z1_30mL_EDP.md).

## Read before using

Three working stocks are planned, not already present: Orivone 10% w/w DEP (100 mg + 900 mg); Coumarin 20% w/w DEP (1000 mg + 4000 mg); Heliotropal 10% w/w DEP (100 mg + 900 mg). Confirm labels, parent material, homogeneous dissolution and appropriate weighing accuracy. Existing unspecified-basis Coumarin 20% DEP is not silently substituted. Heliotropal means piperonal, not Heliotropin Fleuressence.

All actual raw µL are **UNKNOWN**. This is a temporary basket-first, descending-MASS card. Actual descending raw-volume dispenser order cannot be certified without stock densities. The diagnostic report's “µL” are artificial model coordinates and are forbidden as physical doses. Basket 7 location for Linalyl Acetate is provisional; confirm and move its whole row without altering its mass.

